  example: Fifty Shades of Grey: full book review
  spared: Book review: The Imitation of Christ
  source: Sur la Pénitence
  where: feed-card, related, watch-meta
  lexicon: bad_books_cues
  ask noul: Is this a reading, review or promotion of a book whose selling point is lewdness or contempt for religion (erotica, 'spicy' romance, anti-religious polemic)?
  gate: lexicon
  flag at: 0.80
  action: feed-card=dim, watch-meta=label
  enabled: false

