# The rule author's choice, 2026-11-26 (no sermon is quoted for it; see rules.md). It looks at lists, recommended videos and the video page.
rule occult
  title: Witchcraft, magic and the occult
  name: Occult and New Age
  plain: Flags witchcraft, spells, satanism, crystal healing, the law of attraction and other New Age practice.
  group: anticatholic
  example: Crystal healing for beginners: reiki and chakra cleansing
  example: Witchcraft for beginners: love spells and a full moon ritual
  example: Law of attraction: how I manifested my dream life
  spared: D&D spellcasting for new players: a beginner's guide
  spared: Catholic exorcism: a priest explains the Church's rite
  spared: NEW AGE AND PERENNIALISM - THE OUROBOROS OF MODERN HISTORY @ Apostolado Glórias de Maria
  spared: Gradualism and Demonic Possession @ Ascent of Mount Carmel
  source: Choice of the rule author
  where: feed-card, related, watch-meta
  lexicon: occult_cues
  ask noul: Does this teach or promote witchcraft, spells, satanism, crystal or energy healing, the law of attraction or another New Age or occult practice as real, and not fantasy fiction, a game, a history lecture or a Catholic warning against it?
  gate: lexicon
  spare channel: catholic_channels
  flag at: 0.80
  action: feed-card=blank, watch-meta=warn-overlay
  enabled: true

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Unbelief and other religions (group "belief", the first group of the settings page).
# Atheism keeps its sermon (Sur la religion) and protestantism rests on one aside of the Curé (Sur la colère); the other rules
# are the choice of the rule author, 2026-11-26, and rules.md names the Church text each one follows. Every rule here looks at
# lists, recommended videos and the video page; atheism also at comments and subtitles. No word list names a person, and none
# uses a derogatory name for a religion or a group.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

rule denial_of_god
  title: Denying that there is a God
  name: Atheism
