  spared: Liberals, Modernists, and the Gospel for the Fourth Sunday of Lent @ Ascent of Mount Carmel
  spared: New Course: From the Synagogue to Modernism @ Apostolado Glórias de Maria
  source: Pius X, Pascendi dominici gregis (1907); canon 1399, 6. Applying them to videos is a choice of the rule author
  where: feed-card, related, comment, watch-meta
