  ask noul: Does this teach or defend the errors that Pius X condemned as Modernism (that dogma evolves and changes its meaning, that faith is only a feeling, that the Church must change its teaching with the times), and not explain or warn against them from a Catholic viewpoint, or discuss the genuine development of doctrine?
  gate: lexicon
  confirm: model
  spare channel: catholic_channels
  flag at: 0.80
  action: feed-card=blank, watch-meta=warn-overlay
  enabled: true

rule spiritism
